+          <li pn="section-2.5-2.2">
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-2.5-2.2.1">rib-delete: Delete a RIB from a routing instance.  When a RIB is
+deleted, all routes installed in the RIB will be deleted.  A rib-name
+is passed as the input parameter.  The output is the result
+of the delete operation:</t>
+            <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-2.5-2.2.2">
+              <li pn="section-2.5-2.2.2.1">true - success</li>
